onPoint) {\r\n        //Details ommitted\r\n        // ParameterizedType targetType = (ParameterizedType) injectionPoint.getType();\r\n        // Type[] targetTypeArgs = targetType.getActualTypeArguments();\r\n        // ...\r\n        return new BusinessObjectContainer<T>() {\r\n\r\n            @Override\r\n            public void set(T bo) {\r\n                //\r\n            }\r\n        };\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n```\r\nI have some concrete type \"SpecificBusinessObject extends BusinessObject\" where I inject the BusinessObjectContainer with the concrete type argument:\r\n\r\n```\r\n@Inject\r\nBusinessObjectContainer<SpecificBusinessObject> container;\r\n```\r\nJust for completeness; the container looks like this:\r\n\r\n```\r\npublic interface BusinessObjectContainer<T extends BusinessObject> {\r\n    void set(T bo);\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\nAll classes are part of the main quarkus application except SpecificBusinessObject and BusinessObject. They are defined in an external jar that does not contain a beans.xml (it does not contain any CDI beans).\r\n\r\n**Expected behavior**\r\nIt should work; no error on quarkusBuild. As the external jar does not contain any CDI beans, there should not be the need to add a beans.xml.\r\n\r\n\r\n**Actual behavior**\r\n\r\n```\r\nCaused by: javax.enterprise.inject.UnsatisfiedResolutionException: Unsatisfied dependency for type org.acme.BusinessObjectContainer<org.acme.SpecificBusinessObject> and qualifiers [@Default]\r\n- java member: org.acme.ExampleResource#container\r\n- declared on CLASS bean [types=[org.acme.ExampleResource, java.lang.Object], qualifiers=[@Default, @Any], target=org.acme.ExampleResource]\r\n```\r\n\r\nAs soon as I add a beans.xml to the external jar, all works.\r\n\r\n**Environment (please complete the following information):**\r\n - Output of `uname -a` or `ver`: Linux dev-vm.local 3.10.0-862.11.6.el7.x86_64 #1 SMP Tue Aug 14 21:49:04 UTC 2018 x86_64 x86_64 x86_64 GNU/Linux\r\n - Output of `java -version`: java version \"1.8.0_151\"\r\nJava(TM) SE Runtime Environment (build 1.8.0_151-b12)\r\nJava HotSpot(TM) 64-Bit Server VM (build 25.151-b12, mixed mode)\r\n - Quarkus version or git rev: 1.7.1.Final\r\n - Build tool (ie. output of `mvnw --version` or `gradlew --version`): Gradle 6.5.1\r\n\r\n**Additional context**\r\nhttps://quarkusio.zulipchat.com/#narrow/stream/187030-users/topic/CDI.20producer.20with.20generic.20type.20argument\r\n\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"mkouba","id":913004,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkxMzAwNA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/913004?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mkouba","html_url":"https://github.com/mkouba","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mkouba/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mkouba/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mkouba/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mkouba/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mkouba/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mkouba/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mkouba/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mkouba/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mkouba/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quarkusio/quarkus/issues/11863/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quarkusio/quarkus/issues/11863/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}